			"Message": "style(Mist): Allow non-snake_case identifiers in module\n\nAdd `#![allow(non_snake_case)]` lint attribute to suppress Rust warnings for PascalCase naming conventions used throughout the CodeEditorLand project.\n\nThe project follows PascalCase for all identifiers (functions, variables, structs, modules) as documented in CLAUDE.md. This attribute permits the Mist module to use the same naming conventions as other Land components without generating lint warnings.",
